<p>NOTES: Year ended Dec. 31, 1996 included a pretax charge of $90 million, or $1.07 a share, related to the plant closures, and a pretax gain of $28 million, or 34 cents a share, from the sale of shares the company owned in ETEC Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Latest quarter included a plant closure charge of $90 million, or $1 a share, and a pretax gain of $10 million, or 12 cents a share, from the sale of ETEC shares. The difference between the plant closure per share amount for the fourth quarter and full year 1996 is due to the issuance of an additional 8,050,000 shares in June 1996.</p>
<p>Northrop Grumman had a weighted average of 57,780,455 shares outstanding during Q4 1996 compared with a weighted average of 49,438,603 shares outstanding during Q4 1995.</p>
<p>For all of 1996, the company had a weighted average of 54,011,766 shares outstanding compared with a weighted average of 49,363,823 shares outstanding during 1995.</p>
